                "title": "Georgetown Lever with Carre Plate",
                "description": "The Georgetown Lever with Carre Plate has a unique style that manages to straddle the line between contemporary design and traditional glamour for an end look that is stunning. The Georgetown Lever with Carre Tall Plate is available in an array of beautiful finish colors in dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Carre Tall Plate with Georgetown Leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
